    "title": "Kanye West breaks silence amid Bianca Censori divorce with creepy message about 'coercion'",
    "text": "By Eve Buckland for Dailymail.com and Alison Boshoff and Rebecca Lawrence for Mailonline\nPublished: 20:40 GMT, February 13, 2025 | Updated: 20:40 GMT, February 13, 2025\nKanye West has broken his silence in the midst of his divorce from Bianca Censori with a spooky Instagram message on Thursday.\nThe 47 -year -old rapper, whose 29 -year -old separation was revealed exclusively by Daily Mail, shared a definition of ‘coercion’ one hour after his divorce heartbreak broke out.\nKanye West has broken his silence in the midst of his divorce from Bianca Censori with a spooky Instagram message on Thursday (in the photo of February 2)\nMore followers.\nShare or comment on this article: Kanye West breaks silence in the middle of Bianca Censori divorce with a spooky message about ‘coercion’\n(Tagstotranslate) Dailymail (T) TVSHOWBIZ (T) Instagram (T) Kanye West (T) Bianca Censori",
